t of  close games this year against some teams  that you would call inferior they're  gonna have to keep threading the needle  week in and week out to have a shot at  toppling the Patriots in the AFC East  and obviously you have to beat him in  the division before you have any  semblance of hosting games in the  postseason of being a real threat to  advance to the Super Bowl  that's it for this edition of pft ot  check us out for more on Yahoo Sports  throughout the 2019 NFL season  you  [Music]  hi I'm Mike Tirico and thanks for  watching make sure to hit subscribe for  the latest news and highlights from NBC  Sports

